ano il quartier generale della Legione dei Super-Eroi per rubare una Sfera Temporale e nel tentativo di fermarli Star Boy viene catapultato insieme a loro nel passato. Al suo arrivo nel presente Star Boy – aka Thomas Kallor – viene rinchiuso ad Arkham visti anche i suoi disturbi curati nel futuro ma evidentissimi ai giorni nostri, passeranno 10 mesi prima che Superman e Mr Terrific capiranno che la Sfera contiene dei passeggeri."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The Justice League faces a powerful new threat — the Fatal Five! Superman, Batman and Wonder Woman seek answers as the time-traveling trio of Mano, Persuader and Tharok terrorize Metropolis in search of budding Green Lantern, Jessica Cruz. With her unwilling help, they aim to free remaining Fatal Five members Emerald Empress and Validus to carry out their sinister plan. But the Justice League has also discovered an ally from another time in the peculiar Star Boy — brimming with volatile power, could he be the key to thwarting the Fatal Five? An epic battle against ultimate evil awaits!","tagline":"When the future collides with the past, there's no time to waste."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nR3tZp1DksP4oZKph0xbF6L7V2U.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":537059,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xXC0HrmyQDXlYTiHP7Tq6nzurDI.jpg","lan